    "message": "docs: my-claude-code branding + mcc commands + retaken dashboard screenshots\n\nThe project rebranded to My Claude Code (v5.0.0) but README, docs/USAGE,\nARCHITECTURE, the in-dashboard Guide and the screenshots still showed the old\nFree Claude Code / fcc-* surface. This brings them current:\n\n- README/docs/USAGE/ARCHITECTURE: fcc-* command references -> mcc-* with the\n  legacy aliases noted; version pin 4.16.0 -> 5.5.1;\n  WEBSEARCH_LOG_CONTENT_MAX_CHARS 50000 -> 2000000.\n- In-dashboard Guide (index.html): mcc-claude/mcc-codex/mcc-pi/mcc-compact-log\n  with legacy alias notes.\n- Screenshots retaken against the current v5.5.1 UI (Midnight theme, MC mark,\n  readable websearch cards) via a throwaway server on a fake home; both\n  assets/ and admin_static/img/ copies updated.\n\nVerified: 112 docs/brand/admin tests pass; throwaway server stopped, fake home\nremoved. Not retaken: terminal/desktop captures (cc-model-picker, codex*,\nclaude-desktop-*) which can't be reproduced via the admin browser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
